<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dole Food cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dole Food cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it removed Dole Food Co Inc from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- says now rates as market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Thursday, Dole posted second quarter earnings of $1.17 a share compared to $1.05 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Dole lost 2-1/2 to 41-1/2.</p>
</text>
